Package: libssl4
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Secure Sockets Layer toolkit - shared libraries
 This package is part of the OpenSSL project's implementation of the SSL
 and TLS cryptographic protocols for secure communication over the
 Internet.
 .
 It provides the libssl and libcrypto shared libraries (libssl.so.4 and
 libcrypto.so.4).
 .
 This is a local rebuild of OpenSSL 4 for Ubuntu 26.04, which ships OpenSSL 3.5.
 It installs next to libssl3t64 and carries nothing else: no openssl command,
 no development files and no providers, so that the packages of OpenSSL 3.5
 stay untouched.
